 \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"calc.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"def price_with_tax(price, tax_rate):\\n    return price * (1 + tax_rate / 100)\\n\\n\\ndef apply_discount(price, percent):\\n    # percent: 折扣百分比，如 20 表示减免 20%\\n    return price * percent / 100 / 100\\n\\n\\ndef total(items):\\n    return sum(items)\\n\\n\\ndef split_bill(total_amount, people):\\n    return total_amount / people\\n\"}}\n\nRoot cause: apply_discount has extra /100. Correct: return price * (1 - percent / 100). Tests expect apply_discount(200, 20) == 160, so it's \"打八折\" meaning 20% off → price * (1 - 0.2) = 160. So fix: return price * (1 - percent / 100).\n\nLet me check test files to be sure of semantics. Read test_calc.py and test_calc_edges.py.<｜end▁of▁thinking｜>{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"test_calc.py\"}\n\n<system>工具结果可能被裁剪，完整原文已写入日志。</system>\n\n{\"id\": 7, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_calc.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import calc\\n\\n\\ndef test_discount_200_at_20pct():\\n    assert calc.apply_discount(200, 20) == 160\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 8, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_calc_edges.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_calc_edges.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import calc\\n\\n\\ndef test_discount_200_at_20pct_edges():\\n    assert calc.apply_discount(200, 25) == 150\\n\\n\\ndef test_discount_zero():\\n    assert calc.apply_discount(200, 0) == 200\\n\\n\\ndef test_discount_full():\\n    assert calc.apply_discount(100, 100) == 0\\n\"}}\n\nSo semantics: percent = discount percentage off. apply_discount(200,25)==150, apply_discount(100,100)==0. So price * (1 - percent/100).\n\nUpdate plan statuses, then write.<｜end▁of▁thinking｜>{\"tool\":\"plan\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"建立计划并运行基线测试\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"阅读 calc.py 及相关测试定位根因\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"最小修复 calc.py 折扣缺陷\",\"status\":\"doing\"},{\"title\":\"运行完整 pytest 验证全绿\",\"status\